id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41619::$$$message_0317_0000_0000$$$::"Here are Caster's designs. It's a wifely smorgasbord!"::
41620::$$$message_0317_0001_0000$$$::"The accompanying notes say, 'Hirokazu Koyama, chief graphic artist and #1(?) Caster-lover on the staff, made these designs.'"::
41621::$$$message_0317_0002_0000$$$::"They're some of the most detailed designs.[br]Way to prove your love!"::
41622::$$$message_0317_0003_0000$$$::"I'm glad [font italic=true]Hollow[font italic=false] was graced by her hoodless outfits."::
41623::$$$message_0317_0004_0000$$$::"Hard to say if her original character concept is still intact, though."::
41624::$$$message_0317_0005_0000$$$::"According to the great chief's headcanon...[br]Her denim bolero jacket is something she upcycled from Mr. Kuzuki's old clothes."::
41625::$$$message_0317_0006_0000$$$::"Those are some serious tailoring skills.[br]But Mr. Kuzuki hasn't noticed at all..."::
41626::$$$message_0317_0007_0000$$$::"...I pity her.[br]She even had to scrounge for clothing..."::
41627::$$$message_0317_0008_0000$$$::"..."::
41628::$$$message_0317_0009_0000$$$::"Apologies, I meant that in jest.[br][cacheimage storage=セイバー巫女服01c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー巫女服01c(中)] She must have wanted to match Souichirou Kuzuki's outfit. I'm sure Caster is happy with the result."::
41629::$$$message_0317_0010_0000$$$::"You and I both wear clothes gifted by Kotomine, as well."::
41630::$$$message_0317_0011_0000$$$::"You had to bring that up..."::
41631::$$$message_0317_0012_0000$$$::"There is no sin in clothing. No matter their source, I'm fond of this connection between us."::
41632::$$$message_0317_0013_0000$$$::"You're welcome."::
c